{"id":"n17971-5-5","stage":3,"title":"이끌다 · 拖","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17971-5-5-1","ko":"넌 또 지친 몸을 이끌고 어디를 가려고 하니?","zh":"你又要拖着疲惫的身体去哪儿啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넌","audio":"/audio/6a4a5bffadc879e8d8ac.mp3"}},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又。","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}},{"text":"지친","meaning":"疲惫，疲乏，疲劳","explanation":"지치다：疲惫，疲乏，疲劳；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"지치다","audio":"/audio/895ef8ad4cdb0b0bcd6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62330","senseId":"1","lemma":"지치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지친","audio":"/audio/3b61dd152bcf881ef3cf.mp3"}},{"text":"몸을","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몸을","audio":"/audio/384974e1d9816572ab28.mp3"}},{"text":"이끌고","meaning":"拖","explanation":"이끌다：拖；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이끌다","audio":"/audio/90029ec3072fe5ec2979.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17971","senseId":"5","lemma":"이끌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이끌고","audio":"/audio/1b0c02dae18687baf5b0.mp3"}},{"text":"어디를","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","l